# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationReBootstrap. LatticeFallOffLogDetector is
# what requests the re-bootstrap; without it the entries the trim skipped never reach r.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceFallOffUndetected
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a trim past the receiver is not detected, so no re-bootstrap repairs the entries it skipped
PERTURBS: Trim

--- FIND
    /\ fellOff' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: fall-off is not detected.
    /\ fellOff' = fellOff
--- END
